	(text "Compatible with STDC14\n\nPin 11 (GNDDetect) can detect\nJTAG cable presence using a 100k\npull-up plus a spare GPIO\n\nThe watchdog shuts off motors when not petted\nJTAG, SWD, BOOT0 do NOT disable the watchdog\nSo, using JTAG/SWD/flash-over-UART stops motors"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 107.95 167.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "684d6a7d-c5ed-4b75-b45d-a544822f7292")
	)
	(text "TTL-234X-3V3 cable: 1 GND, 4 TXD -> STM32-RX, 5 RXD <- STM32-TX\n2 CTS#, 3 VCC, 6 RTS# not connected\n\nAll debug, spare headers are vertical, not right angle"
